I’ve learned some lessons. I know there's a non-separable element and evidence of coupling among variables 0-32. I also know that there's a unimodal basin. I have used Inverse models, and they've worked, as have fallback models. GCR failed. I now have a plan for Inverse Manifold Refinement.

